modreloader.relaunch.jbr.late_at_warning:
The restarted session enables what is needed for access transformers:
- it rewrites access flags of already-loaded vanilla/NeoForge classes, process-wide; nothing is reverted afterwards;
- JBR 21 only, and only L1-verified (Jade/JEI/Controlling); Windows/Linux untested;
- only for jars you trust; other registration/payload/dependency gates can still refuse the add;
- this session only: the next launch is decided by the launcher.
